This parameter is required.', example='a65451293e64979ba7a4b573950217fe'),
  cronExpression?: string(name='cronExpression', description='Cron expression (UTC+8). Required when trigger type is `Cron`.', example='0 0 0 ? * 1'),
  description?: string(name='description', description='Description, up to 256 characters in length.', example='example'),
  detectConfigName?: string(name='detectConfigName', description='Detection configuration Name

This parameter is required.', example='test'),
  enabled?: boolean(name='enabled', description='Whether the Detection feature is Enabled. The default value is `true`.'),
  triggerType?: string(name='triggerType', description='Trigger type  
- Manual: Execute manually  
